
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There is a lot to process after this week&#8217;s Apple event. If you&#8217;re still sorting through it all, I found two videos worth your time.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">First is Marques Brownlee&#8217;s <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Od6M0AXpcxQ">iPhone 18 Pro/Duo Impressions: Mogged</a>. Marques has a good feel for this stuff, and I always value his initial reactions. I don&#8217;t agree with him about the Apple Watch recording feature. He lands closer to the creepy side of that debate. I don&#8217;t think it is nearly as troubling as some people are making it out to be, although we&#8217;ll know more once people start using it in the wild.</p>



