https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zt-fS0DH8BQ
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That makes the variable aperture less of a single flashy feature and more of a tool that lets Apple build a more flexible camera. Either way, if you like taking pictures with your phone, I think the iPhone 18 Pro is going to be a really nice upgrade.</p>
